note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note The first six entries remain the native head catalogue. Append the 28
note backbone kernels in kernels.list order, followed by the 2 SM121a QMMA
note kernels (28 = mmaFp4, 29 = mmaFp8Block), and keep one immutable code image.
text dnKinds "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzAB"

fn dnIns lo ulong hi ulong to void
  w = new ulong 4 0
  put w 0 and lo 4294967295
  put w 1 shr lo 32
  put w 2 and hi 4294967295
  put w 3 shr hi 32
  dsWrite w
end

